{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# SoV orthogonality at zero twist — gl(4), L = 2, `[S,S,0,0] x [P,P,0,0]`\n\nThe twisted construction (`../Clean/SU4_SoV_ScalarProduct_L2.wb`) proves orthogonality from the linear system\n\n$$0 = \\oint \\mu\\, q^{\\,j}_A\\,(\\mathcal O^A - \\mathcal O^B)\\, q_i^{B[2]} ,$$\n\nwhich is linear in the differences of the integrals of motion. At zero twist (`z_j = 1`) most of those differences become linearly dependent. This notebook identifies the dependencies, reduces the system to **two** independent integrals of motion, and verifies that the resulting **2x2 matrix** has vanishing determinant for distinct states and nonvanishing determinant (norm) for each state.\n\nEverything is exact: rational parameters `θ1 = 1/3, θ2 = 1/7, h = 1` for the Q-functions, and symbolic `θ1, θ2, h, S, P, μ` for the integral-of-motion identities. Write-up: `SU4_SoV_Orthogonality_Untwisted_L2.tex`. Run top to bottom from a fresh kernel.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 1. Untwisted (z_j = 1) chain. nu_1 = nu_2 = (u-θ1-Sh)(u-θ2-Ph), nu_3 = nu_4 = (u-θ1)(u-θ2).\n   tau_a: leading coefficient Binomial[4,a]; subleading -a(θ1+θ2+(a-1)h) Binomial[4,a] - h Binomial[3,a-1] Sum(mu),\n   which at z=1 no longer sees the individual weights; five free coefficients tc[1..5]. ---- *)\nClearAll[ν, ν1, ν4, qdet, subl, τ, τ3quad, tc, tcvars, Mdeg, qpoly, BaxRes, BaxResD, prm];\nprm = {θ1 -> 1/3, θ2 -> 1/7, h -> 1};\nν[S_, P_][i_][u_] := (u - θ1 - h {S, S, 0, 0}[[i]]) (u - θ2 - h {P, P, 0, 0}[[i]]);\nν1[S_, P_][u_] := ν[S, P][1][u];\nν4[S_, P_][u_] := ν[S, P][4][u];\nqdet[S_, P_][u_] := Product[ν[S, P][i][u - (4 - i) h], {i, 4}];\nsubl[a_, μ_] := -a (θ1 + θ2 + (a - 1) h) Binomial[4, a] - h Binomial[3, a - 1] Total[μ];\ntcvars = Array[tc, 5];\nτ[1][S_, P_, μ_][u_] := 4 u^2 + subl[1, μ] u + tc[1];\nτ[2][S_, P_, μ_][u_] := 6 u^4 + subl[2, μ] u^3 + tc[2] u^2 + tc[3] u + tc[4];\nτ3quad[S_, P_, μ_] := Module[{x, bb}, bb /. First@Solve[Coefficient[Expand[ν1[S, P][x - 2 h] ν4[S, P][x] (4 x^2 + bb x + tc[5])], x, 5] == subl[3, μ], bb]];\nτ[3][S_, P_, μ_][u_] := ν1[S, P][u - 2 h] ν4[S, P][u] (4 u^2 + τ3quad[S, P, μ] u + tc[5]);\nτ[4][S_, P_, μ_][u_] := qdet[S, P][u];\nMdeg[S_, P_, μ_] := (S + P) - μ;\nqpoly[c_List, y_] := Module[{x}, (c . x^Range[0, Length[c] - 1]) /. x -> y];\n(* Baxter operator O acting on Q (O q^[2] = 0), and its dual O-dagger, both multiplied by their denominators *)\nBaxRes[S_, P_, μ_][qf_][x_] := Product[ν1[S, P][x - m h], {m, 0, 3}] qf[x + h] - τ[1][S, P, μ][x] Product[ν1[S, P][x - m h], {m, 1, 3}] qf[x] + τ[2][S, P, μ][x] Product[ν1[S, P][x - m h], {m, 2, 3}] qf[x - h] - τ[3][S, P, μ][x] ν1[S, P][x - 3 h] qf[x - 2 h] + τ[4][S, P, μ][x] qf[x - 3 h];\nBaxResD[S_, P_, μ_][G_][x_] := Product[ν4[S, P][x + m h], {m, 1, 4}] G[x] - τ[1][S, P, μ][x + h] Product[ν4[S, P][x + m h], {m, 2, 4}] G[x + h] + τ[2][S, P, μ][x + 2 h] Product[ν4[S, P][x + m h], {m, 3, 4}] G[x + 2 h] - τ[3][S, P, μ][x + 3 h] ν4[S, P][x + 4 h] G[x + 3 h] + τ[4][S, P, μ][x + 4 h] G[x + 4 h];\n\"1. loaded\"",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"969947\" data-output-id=\"0\" data-out-n=\"18\" data-sub-idx=\"19\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"21\" data-sub-end=\"21\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[18]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"7\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7MS4gbG9hZGVkfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">1. loaded</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[18]= \\text{1. loaded}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "548e5652-311c-43c8-8074-fb3f550491e5"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. Q-functions at zero twist\n\nFor each irrep `μ` of `[S,S,0,0] x [P,P,0,0]` (multiplicity free: `μ = {S+P-j, S+P-k, k, j}`, `0 <= j <= k <= min(S,P)`) the four direct solutions are monic polynomials `q_k` of staggered degrees `(S+P) - μ_k + (k-1)`, and the four dual solutions `q^j` of `O†` have degrees `μ_4, μ_3+1, μ_2+2, μ_1+3` for `j = 4,3,2,1`. The staggering gauge (coefficient of each lower degree set to zero in the higher solutions) makes both families unique. One joint solve fixes `tc` and the `q_k`; the duals are then linear.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 2. Exact solver: tc, q_1..q_4, q^1..q^4 for one irrep. ---- *)\nClearAll[irrepsSP, UntwSolve, cq, ce, states];\nirrepsSP[S_, P_] := Flatten[Table[{S + P - j, S + P - k, k, j}, {j, 0, Min[S, P]}, {k, j, Min[S, P]}], 1];\nUntwSolve[S_, P_, μ_] := Module[{dh = Mdeg[S, P, μ] + Range[0, 3], dd = μ[[{4, 3, 2, 1}]] + Range[0, 3], js = {4, 3, 2, 1}, x, pf, G, eqs, sol, rec, qd = <||>},\n   pf[k_] := Function[y, Evaluate[y^dh[[k]] + Sum[cq[k, m] y^m, {m, 0, dh[[k]] - 1}]]];\n   eqs = Join[DeleteCases[Flatten[Table[CoefficientList[Expand[BaxRes[S, P, μ][pf[k]][x] /. prm], x], {k, 4}]], 0],\n     Flatten[Table[If[dh[[l]] < dh[[k]], cq[k, dh[[l]]], Nothing], {k, 4}, {l, k - 1}]]];\n   sol = Solve[(# == 0 &) /@ eqs, Join[tcvars, Flatten[Table[cq[k, m], {k, 4}, {m, 0, dh[[k]] - 1}]]]];\n   If[Length[sol] =!= 1, Return[$Failed]];\n   rec = <|\"mu\" -> μ, \"tc\" -> (tcvars /. First[sol]), \"q\" -> Table[CoefficientList[pf[k][x] /. First[sol], x], {k, 4}]|>;\n   Do[With[{j = js[[a]]},\n     G = Function[y, Evaluate[y^dd[[a]] + Sum[ce[j, m] y^m, {m, 0, dd[[a]] - 1}]]];\n     eqs = Join[DeleteCases[CoefficientList[Expand[BaxResD[S, P, μ][G][x] /. Thread[tcvars -> rec[\"tc\"]] /. prm], x], 0],\n       Table[If[dd[[b]] < dd[[a]], ce[j, dd[[b]]], Nothing], {b, a - 1}]];\n     sol = Solve[(# == 0 &) /@ eqs, Table[ce[j, m], {m, 0, dd[[a]] - 1}]];\n     qd[j] = If[Length[sol] === 1, CoefficientList[G[x] /. First[sol], x], $Failed]], {a, 4}];\n   Append[rec, \"qd\" -> qd]];\nstates[S_, P_] := states[S, P] = UntwSolve[S, P, #] & /@ irrepsSP[S, P];\n\n(* CHECK: unique solutions; O q_k^[2] = 0 and O-dagger q^j = 0 identically in u *)\nGrid[Prepend[Flatten[Table[With[{r = #, x = Unique[\"x\"]}, {sp, r[\"mu\"], r[\"tc\"], Length /@ r[\"q\"] - 1, Length /@ Values[r[\"qd\"]] - 1,\n       And @@ Table[Expand[BaxRes[sp[[1]], sp[[2]], r[\"mu\"]][Function[y, qpoly[r[\"q\"][[k]], y]]][x] /. Thread[tcvars -> r[\"tc\"]] /. prm] === 0, {k, 4}],\n       And @@ Table[Expand[BaxResD[sp[[1]], sp[[2]], r[\"mu\"]][Function[y, qpoly[r[\"qd\"][j], y]]][x] /. Thread[tcvars -> r[\"tc\"]] /. prm] === 0, {j, 4}]}] & /@ states @@ sp, {sp, {{1, 1}, {2, 1}, {2, 2}}}], 1],\n  {\"(S,P)\", \"mu\", \"tc\", \"deg q_1..q_4\", \"deg q^4..q^1\", \"O q_k^[2] = 0\", \"O† q^j = 0\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"969947\" data-output-id=\"1\" data-out-n=\"23\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"3\" data-sub-start=\"20\" data-sub-end=\"23\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[23]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"10\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:15.76em;vertical-align:-7.61em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.11em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:15.72em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-7.61em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.11em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.27em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(S,P)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.06em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.64em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.43em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.22em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.8em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.59em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.62em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.83em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:3.04em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:4.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:7.61em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:15.72em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-7.61em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.11em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.27em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mu</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.06em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.64em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.43em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></sp