  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. The integrals of motion at zero twist\n\nAt `z = 1` the transfer-matrix eigenvalues depend on the irrep only through the Casimirs (closed form from `baxter_SU4_L2_XXX.wb`, cells 5, 7, 9, 10, 17; `Δ` = difference from the vacuum `[S+P,S+P,0,0]`):\n\n$$\\tau_1 = \\tau_1^{vac} + \\tfrac{h^2}{2}\\Delta C_2,\\quad \\tau_2 = \\tau_2^{vac} + \\tfrac{h^2}{8}\\Delta C_2\\,\\big(\\tau_1^{vac}+\\tau_1^{vac[-2]}\\big) + h^4\\big(\\tfrac18\\Delta(C_2^2) - \\tfrac14\\Delta C_4\\big) + \\tfrac{h^4(1+2S+2P)}{4}\\Delta C_2,\\quad \\tau_3 = \\nu_1^{[-4]}\\nu_4\\big[\\cdots + \\tfrac{h^2}{2}\\Delta C_2\\big],$$\n\nwith `τ_1^{vac} = Σ_i ν_i = 2ν_1 + 2ν_4`. The cell below (a) checks this against the Baxter-solved `tc` of every irrep, and (b) proves, symbolically in `θ1, θ2, h, S, P` and two generic weights with `Σμ = 2(S+P)`, that for any two states\n\n$$\\Delta T_1 = \\Delta tc_1,\\qquad \\Delta T_2 = \\tfrac14\\Delta tc_1\\big(\\tau_1^{vac} + \\tau_1^{vac[-2]}\\big) + \\Delta c,\\qquad \\Delta T_3 = \\nu_4\\,\\nu_1^{[-4]}\\,\\Delta tc_1,$$\n\n$$\\Delta tc_1 = \\tfrac{h^2}{2}\\Delta C_2,\\qquad \\Delta c = h^4\\Big(\\tfrac18\\Delta(C_2^2) - \\tfrac14\\Delta C_4 + \\tfrac{1+2S+2P}{4}\\Delta C_2\\Big).$$\n\nSo of the eight differences entering the twisted system only **two** remain independent, `Δtc_1` and `Δc`; the other six (the three weights and three of the five `tc`) are fixed by them.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 3. Casimir form of tc (ported from baxter_SU4_L2_XXX.wb) and the three identities. ---- *)\nClearAll[xw, Pw, Cas2, Cas4, t1vac, t2vac, tauVac3, tcCas, m, n];\nxw[mu_] := Table[mu[[i]] + 5/2 - i, {i, 4}]; Pw[mu_, k_] := Total[xw[mu]^k];\nCas2[mu_] := Pw[mu, 2] - 5;\nCas4[mu_] := Pw[mu, 4] + 4 Pw[mu, 3] - Pw[mu, 1] Pw[mu, 2] + Pw[mu, 2]/2 - 2 Pw[mu, 1]^2 - 10 Pw[mu, 1] - 51/4;\nt1vac[S_, P_][y_] := Sum[ν[S, P][k][y], {k, 4}];\nt2vac[S_, P_][y_] := Sum[ν[S, P][i][y - h] ν[S, P][j][y], {i, 4}, {j, i + 1, 4}];\ntauVac3[S_, P_][y_] := Total[(ν[S, P][#[[1]]][y - 2 h] ν[S, P][#[[2]]][y - h] ν[S, P][#[[3]]][y]) & /@ Subsets[Range[4], {3}]];\ntcCas[S_, P_, mu_] := Module[{x, mt = {S + P, S + P, 0, 0}, d2, T1, T2, q3},\n   d2 = Cas2[mu] - Cas2[mt];\n   T1 = Expand[t1vac[S, P][x] + h^2/2 d2];\n   T2 = Expand[t2vac[S, P][x] + h^2/8 d2 (t1vac[S, P][x] + t1vac[S, P][x - h]) + h^4 ((Cas2[mu]^2 - Cas2[mt]^2)/8 - (Cas4[mu] - Cas4[mt])/4) + h^4 (1 + 2 S + 2 P)/4 d2];\n   q3 = PolynomialQuotient[Expand[tauVac3[S, P][x]], Expand[ν1[S, P][x - 2 h] ν4[S, P][x]], x];\n   {Coefficient[T1, x, 0], Coefficient[T2, x, 2], Coefficient[T2, x, 1], Coefficient[T2, x, 0], Coefficient[q3, x, 0] + h^2/2 d2}];\n\n(* (a) Casimir tc == Baxter-solved tc, every irrep *)\nchkTc = And @@ Flatten[Table[(Simplify[(tcCas[sp[[1]], sp[[2]], #[\"mu\"]] /. prm) - #[\"tc\"]] === {0, 0, 0, 0, 0}) & /@ states @@ sp, {sp, {{1, 1}, {2, 1}, {2, 2}}}]];\n(* (b) the three identities, symbolic *)\nidChk = Module[{mA = {m[1], m[2], m[3], 2 (S + P) - m[1] - m[2] - m[3]}, mB = {n[1], n[2], n[3], 2 (S + P) - n[1] - n[2] - n[3]}, dT, dtc1, dc},\n   dT[a_][y_] := (τ[a][S, P, mA][y] /. Thread[tcvars -> tcCas[S, P, mA]]) - (τ[a][S, P, mB][y] /. Thread[tcvars -> tcCas[S, P, mB]]);\n   dtc1 = h^2/2 (Cas2[mA] - Cas2[mB]);\n   dc = h^4 ((Cas2[mA]^2 - Cas2[mB]^2)/8 - (Cas4[mA] - Cas4[mB])/4 + (1 + 2 S + 2 P)/4 (Cas2[mA] - Cas2[mB]));\n   Simplify[{dT[1][u] - dtc1, dT[2][u] - (dtc1/4 (t1vac[S, P][u] + t1vac[S, P][u - h]) + dc), dT[3][u] - ν4[S, P][u] ν1[S, P][u - 2 h] dtc1}]];\nGrid[{{\"(a) Casimir tc = Baxter tc, all 12 irreps\", chkTc}, {\"(b) {ΔT1 - Δtc1, ΔT2 - [Δtc1/4 (τ1vac+τ1vac[-2]) + Δc], ΔT3 - ν4 ν1[-4] Δtc1}\", idChk}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"331408\" data-output-id=\"57\" data-out-n=\"440\" data-sub-idx=\"13\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"5\" data-sub-start=\"23\" data-sub-end=\"23\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[440]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"8\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(a) Casimir tc = Baxter tc, all 12 irreps</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(b) {ΔT1 - Δtc1, ΔT2 - [Δtc1/4 (</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mord\">1vac+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mord\">1vac[-2]) + Δc], ΔT3 - </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">4 </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">1[-4] Δtc1}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[440]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{(a) Casimir tc = Baxter tc, all 12 irreps} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{(b) \\{$\\Delta$T1 - $\\Delta$tc1, $\\Delta$T2 - [$\\Delta$tc1/4 ($\\tau$1vac+$\\tau$1vac[-2]) + $\\Delta$c], $\\Delta$T3 - $\\nu$4 $\\nu$1[-4] $\\Delta$tc1\\}} & \\left\\{0,0,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "4b828546-0beb-4cb0-bc16-2de16519c806"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3. The 2x2 matrix\n\nInsert the three identities into the unaligned orthogonality relation\n\n$$0 = \\oint \\mu\\, q^{\\,j}_A \\Big[-\\frac{\\Delta T_1}{\\nu_1} q^B_i + \\frac{\\Delta T_2}{\\nu_1\\nu_1^{[-2]}} q^{B[-2]}_i - \\frac{\\Delta T_3}{\\nu_1\\nu_1^{[-2]}\\nu_1^{[-4]}} q^{B[-4]}_i\\Big] .$$\n\nWith `E_2 = μ/(ν_1 ν_1^{[-2]})`, `μ = 1/∏_α∏_{n=0}^{S_α-1}(u-θ_α-nh)`, and `L_s` the sum of residues over the pole ladder of site `s` (`θ_s + nh`, `n = 0..S_s+1`):\n\n$$N^{AB}_{s,1} = L_s\\Big[E_2\\, q^{\\,j}_A\\Big(-\\nu_1^{[-2]} q^B_i + \\tfrac12\\big(\\nu_1+\\nu_1^{[-2]}+\\nu_4+\\nu_4^{[-2]}\\big) q^{B[-2]}_i - \\nu_4\\, q^{B[-4]}_i\\Big)\\Big],\\qquad N^{AB}_{s,2} = L_s\\Big[E_2\\, q^{\\,j}_A\\, q^{B[-2]}_i\\Big],$$\n\n$$N^{AB}\\cdot(\\Delta tc_1,\\ \\Delta c)^T = 0 .$$\n\nThe two ladders are independent functionals because an `h`-periodic insertion (e.g. `e^{2π i u/h}`) is constant on each ladder and may be added freely. Hence `det N^{AB} = 0` whenever `(Δtc_1, Δc) ≠ 0`, and `det N^{AA}` is the norm.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 4. The 2x2 matrix N^{AB} for a direct q_i of B and a dual q^j of A. ---- *)\nClearAll[mMeas, E2, Lsum, N2, invs];\nmMeas[S_, P_][x_] := 1/(Product[x - θ1 - k h, {k, 0, S - 1}] Product[x - θ2 - k h, {k, 0, P - 1}]);\nE2[S_, P_][x_] := (mMeas[S, P][x]/(ν1[S, P][x] ν1[S, P][x - h])) /. prm;\nLsum[S_, P_][f_, s_, x_] := Sum[Residue[E2[S, P][x] f, {x, ({θ1, θ2}[[s]] + k h) /. prm}], {k, 0, {S, P}[[s]] + 1}];\nN2[S_, P_, A_, B_, i_, j_] := Module[{x, hh = h /. prm, qa, qb, n1, n4, f1, f2},\n   qa = Function[w, qpoly[A[\"qd\"][j], w]]; qb = Function[w, qpoly[B[\"q\"][[i]], w]];\n   n1[y_] := ν1[S, P][y] /. prm; n4[y_] := ν4[S, P][y] /. prm;\n   f1 = Expand[qa[x] (-n1[x - hh] qb[x] + (n1[x] + n1[x - hh] + n4[x] + n4[x - hh])/2 qb[x - hh] - n4[x] qb[x - 2 hh])];\n   f2 = Expand[qa[x] qb[x - hh]];\n   Table[{Lsum[S, P][f1, s, x], Lsum[S, P][f2, s, x]}, {s, 2}]];\n(* the two invariants (Δtc1, Δc) of a pair, from the Baxter-solved tc *)\ninvs[S_, P_, A_, B_] := With[{d = A[\"tc\"] - B[\"tc\"]}, {d[[1]], d[[4]] - d[[1]]/4 ((t1vac[S, P][0] + t1vac[S, P][-h]) /. prm)}];\n\"4. loaded\"",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"331408\" data-output-id=\"58\" data-out-n=\"447\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"7\" data-sub-start=\"13\" data-sub-end=\"13\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[447]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"8\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7NC4gbG9hZGVkfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">4. loaded</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[447]= \\text{4. loaded}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "520df548-571d-4b5e-b26c-8cf6fb5139d5"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 5. Which (i,j) give a nonvanishing norm det N^{AA}, for every irrep? ---- *)\nnormSurvey = Flatten[Table[{{i, j}, Sequence @@ Table[Count[states @@ sp, r_ /; Together[Det[N2[sp[[1]], sp[[2]], r, r, i, j]]] =!= 0], {sp, {{1, 1}, {2, 1}, {2, 2}}}]}, {i, 4}, {j, 4}], 1];\nGrid[Prepend[normSurvey, {\"(i,j)\", \"nonzero norms (1,1), of 3\", \"(2,1), of 3\", \"(2,2), of 6\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"331408\" data-output-id=\"59\" data-out-n=\"449\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"8\" data-sub-start=\"2\" data-sub-end=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[449]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"8\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:20.44em;vertical-align:-9.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:10.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-12.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:12.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:20.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-9.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:10.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-12.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(i,j)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-11.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class