       "data": "Out[457]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{q\\_2 of \\{2,1,1,0\\}} & u^2-\\frac{10\\,u}{21}\\\\\\hline\\text{q\\^{}1 of \\{2,1,1,0\\}} & u^5-\\frac{130\\,u^4}{21}+\\frac{3097\\,u}{63}\\\\\\hline\\text{q\\^{}1 of \\{2,2,0,0\\}} & u^5-\\frac{22525\\,u^3}{1323}+\\frac{16640\\,u^2}{441}\\\\\\hline\\text{N, A = B = \\{2,1,1,0\\}} & \\begin{pmatrix}-\\frac{150144211}{334305} & \\frac{3235736}{334305}\\\\\\frac{692896376}{1820105} & -\\frac{41930251}{1820105}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{det} & \\frac{1039313041}{156009}\\\\\\hline\\text{N, A = \\{2,2,0,0\\}, B = \\{2,1,1,0\\}} & \\begin{pmatrix}-\\frac{320542493}{5014575} & \\frac{320542493}{5014575}\\\\\\frac{1737705523}{27301575} & -\\frac{1737705523}{27301575}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{det} & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{($\\Delta$tc1, $\\Delta$c)} & \\left\\{2,2\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{N.($\\Delta$tc1, $\\Delta$c)} & \\left\\{0,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "44ff11f0-76a8-42b2-a8c0-8a5e170c5683"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3b. Simplifying the first column\n\nOnly constant column operations preserve the determinant structure. The linear parts of the `ν`-combination in column 1 cancel against `ν_1^{[-2]} + ν_4`:\n\n$$\\tfrac12\\big(\\nu_1+\\nu_1^{[-2]}+\\nu_4+\\nu_4^{[-2]}\\big) = \\nu_1^{[-2]} + \\nu_4 - \\tfrac{h^2}{2}(S+P) .$$\n\nSo replacing column 1 by column 1 `+ (h^2/2)(S+P)` × column 2 turns the bracket into a pure difference form. With `∇f = f - f^{[-2]}`,\n\n$$N'^{AB}_{s,1} = L_s\\Big[E_2\\, q^{\\,j}_A\\big(-\\nu_1^{[-2]}\\,\\nabla q^B_i + \\nu_4\\,\\nabla q^{B[-2]}_i\\big)\\Big],\\qquad N'^{AB}_{s,2} = L_s\\Big[E_2\\, q^{\\,j}_A\\, q^{B[-2]}_i\\Big],\\qquad N'^{AB}\\cdot(\\Delta tc_1,\\ \\Delta c')^T = 0,$$\n\n$$\\Delta T_2 = \\Delta tc_1\\big(\\nu_1^{[-2]} + \\nu_4\\big) + \\Delta c',\\qquad \\Delta c' = \\Delta c - \\tfrac{h^2}{2}(S+P)\\,\\Delta tc_1 = h^4\\Big(\\tfrac18\\Delta(C_2^2) - \\tfrac14\\Delta C_4 + \\tfrac{1+S+P}{4}\\Delta C_2\\Big).$$\n\nThe operation is triangular with unit diagonal, so every determinant is unchanged.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 7b. Difference form of column 1: symbolic identities, then N' built directly from the new integrand. ---- *)\nClearAll[N2d, invsd, cShift];\ncShift[S_, P_] := h^2 (S + P)/2;\n(* (a) the nu-identity and (b) Delta T2 in the new basis, both symbolic *)\nchkM = Simplify[1/2 (ν1[S, P][u] + ν1[S, P][u - h] + ν4[S, P][u] + ν4[S, P][u - h]) - (ν1[S, P][u - h] + ν4[S, P][u]) + cShift[S, P]] === 0;\nchkDcp = Module[{mA = {m[1], m[2], m[3], 2 (S + P) - m[1] - m[2] - m[3]}, mB = {n[1], n[2], n[3], 2 (S + P) - n[1] - n[2] - n[3]}, dT2, dtc1, dcp},\n   dT2 = (τ[2][S, P, mA][u] /. Thread[tcvars -> tcCas[S, P, mA]]) - (τ[2][S, P, mB][u] /. Thread[tcvars -> tcCas[S, P, mB]]);\n   dtc1 = h^2/2 (Cas2[mA] - Cas2[mB]);\n   dcp = h^4 ((Cas2[mA]^2 - Cas2[mB]^2)/8 - (Cas4[mA] - Cas4[mB])/4 + (1 + S + P)/4 (Cas2[mA] - Cas2[mB]));\n   Simplify[dT2 - (dtc1 (ν1[S, P][u - h] + ν4[S, P][u]) + dcp)] === 0];\n(* N' directly from the difference-form integrand *)\nN2d[S_, P_, A_, B_, i_, j_] := Module[{x, hh = h /. prm, qa, qb, g, n1, n4, f1, f2},\n   qa = Function[w, qpoly[A[\"qd\"][j], w]]; qb = Function[w, qpoly[B[\"q\"][[i]], w]]; g[y_] := qb[y] - qb[y - hh];\n   n1[y_] := ν1[S, P][y] /. prm; n4[y_] := ν4[S, P][y] /. prm;\n   f1 = Expand[qa[x] (-n1[x - hh] g[x] + n4[x] g[x - hh])];\n   f2 = Expand[qa[x] qb[x - hh]];\n   Table[{Lsum[S, P][f1, s, x], Lsum[S, P][f2, s, x]}, {s, 2}]];\ninvsd[S_, P_, A_, B_] := With[{d = invs[S, P, A, B]}, {d[[1]], d[[2]] - (cShift[S, P] /. prm) d[[1]]}];\n(* (c) N' = N.{{1,0},{c,1}}, det N' = det N, and orthogonality/norms with (Delta tc1, Delta c'), every pair at (i,j) = (2,1) *)\nchkTab = Flatten[Table[With[{st = states @@ sp}, Table[With[{Nd = N2d[sp[[1]], sp[[2]], A, B, 2, 1], N = N2[sp[[1]], sp[[2]], A, B, 2, 1], c = cShift[sp[[1]], sp[[2]]] /. prm},\n       {Together[Nd - N . {{1, 0}, {c, 1}}] === {{0, 0}, {0, 0}}, Together[Det[Nd] - Det[N]] === 0, If[A === B, Together[Det[Nd]] =!= 0, Together[Nd . invsd[sp[[1]], sp[[2]], A, B]] === {0, 0}]}], {A, st}, {B, st}]], {sp, {{1, 1}, {2, 1}, {2, 2}}}], 2];\ndiffFormSummary = {{\"(a) ½(ν1+ν1[-2]+ν4+ν4[-2]) = ν1[-2]+ν4 - h²(S+P)/2, symbolic\", chkM},\n   {\"(b) ΔT2 = Δtc1(ν1[-2]+ν4) + Δc', symbolic\", chkDcp},\n   {\"(c) N' = N.{{1,0},{c,1}}, all 54 pairs\", Count[chkTab[[All, 1]], True]},\n   {\"    det N' = det N, all 54 pairs\", Count[chkTab[[All, 2]], True]},\n   {\"    norms ≠ 0 and cross N'.(Δtc1,Δc') = 0, all 54 pairs\", Count[chkTab[[All, 3]], True]}};\nGrid[diffFormSummary, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"331408\" data-output-id=\"62\" data-out-n=\"466\" data-sub-idx=\"12\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"12\" data-sub-start=\"26\" data-sub-end=\"26\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[466]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"8\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.04em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(a) ½(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">1+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">1[-2]+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">4+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">4[-2]) = </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">1[-2]+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">4 - h²(S+P)/2, symbolic</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(b) ΔT2 = Δtc1(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">1[-2]+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">4) + Δc’, symbolic</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(c) N’ = N.{{1,0},{c,1}}, all 54 pairs</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> det N’ = det N, all 54 pairs</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> norms </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> 0 and cross N’.(Δtc1,Δc’) = 0, all 54 pairs</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">54</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">54</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">54</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[466]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{(a) ½($\\nu$1+$\\nu$1[-2]+$\\nu$4+$\\nu$4[-2]) = $\\nu$1[-2]+$\\nu$4 - h²(S+P)/2, symbolic} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{(b) $\\Delta$T2 = $\\Delta$tc1($\\nu$1[-2]+$\\nu$4) + $\\Delta$c', symbolic} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{(c) N' = N.\\{\\{1,0\\},\\{c,1\\}\\}, all 54 pairs} & 54\\\\\\hline\\text{    det N' = det N, all 54 pairs} & 54\\\\\\hline\\text{    norms $\\not=$ 0 and cross N'.($\\Delta$tc1,$\\Delta$c') = 0, all 54 pairs} & 54\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "55641b1a-ba57-4037-8c5a-d345f6f22e30"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. Variant: full contour, a different pair of Q-functions in each row\n\nInstead of splitting the contour by ladder, each row is the integral over **all** poles (both the `θ_1` and `θ_2` ladders, no periodic insertion), and the two rows use different Q-functions `(i_1, j_1)` and `(i_2, j_2)`:\n\n$$\\tilde N^{AB} = \\begin{pmatrix} \\oint E_2\\, q^{\\,j_1}_A(\\cdots) q^B_{i_1} & \\oint E_2\\, q^{\\,j_1}_A\\, q^{B[-2]}_{i_1} \\\\ \\oint E_2\\, q^{\\,j_2}_A(\\cdots) q^B_{i_2} & \\oint E_2\\, q^{\\,j_2}_A\\, q^{B[-2]}_{i_2} \\end{pmatrix},\\qquad \\tilde N^{AB}\\cdot(\\Delta tc_1, \\Delta c)^T = 0,$$\n\nwith `(⋯)` the same `ν`-combination as in Section 3. Each row is the sum of the two ladder rows of `N`. A full-contour row is minus the residue at infinity, so it can vanish identically when the degrees are low.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 8. Full-contour rows for every (i,j) and irrep; then every pair of distinct rows. ---- *)\nClearAll[rowFull, normRows, ijs, fullSurvey, universalFull];\nrowFull[S_, P_, A_, B_, i_, j_] := Together[Total[N2[S, P, A, B, i, j]]];\nijs = Tuples[Range[4], 2];\nnormRows = Association[Flatten[Table[{sp, r[\"mu\"], ij} -> rowFull[sp[[1]], sp[[2]], r, r, Sequence @@ ij], {sp, {{1, 1}, {2, 1}, {2, 2}}}, {r, states @@ sp}, {ij, ijs}], 2]];\n(* how many irreps (of 12) have an identically zero full-contour row, per (i,j) *)\nzeroRows = Table[{ij, Count[Flatten[Table[normRows[{sp, r[\"mu\"], ij}] === {0, 0}, {sp, {{1, 1}, {2, 1}, {2, 2}}}, {r, states @@ sp}]], True]}, {ij, ijs}];\n(* pairs of distinct (i,j): number of irreps (of 12) with a nonzero norm *)\nfullSurvey = Table[{pr, Count[Flatten[Table[Together[Det[{normRows[{sp, r[\"mu\"], pr[[1]]}], normRows[{sp, r[\"mu\"], pr[[2]]}]}]] =!= 0, {sp, {{1, 1}, {2, 1}, {2, 2}}}, {r, states @@ sp}]], True]}, {pr, Subsets[ijs, {2}]}];\nuniversalFull = Select[fullSurvey, #[[2]] == 12 &][[All, 1]];\nColumn[{Grid[Prepend[zeroRows, {\"(i,j)\", \"irreps with zero full row (of 12)\"}], Frame -> All],\n  Row[{\"pairs of rows with nonzero norm for all 12 irreps: \", Length[universalFull], \" of \", Length[fullSurvey]}],\n  Row[{\"they are: \", universalFull}],\n  Row[{\"distribution of #irreps with nonzero norm over the 120 pairs: \", Sort[Tally[fullSurvey[[All, 2]]]]}]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"331408\" data-output-id=\"63\" data-out-n=\"474\" data-sub-idx=\"10\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"14\" data-sub-start=\"10\" data-sub-end=\"13\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[474]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"8\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:73.241em;vertical-align:-36.3705em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:36.8705em;\"><span style=\"top:-53.2311em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:26.8506em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:10.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-12.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:12.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:20.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-9.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:10.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-12.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(i,j)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-11.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\