ht:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">D00 nonzero over all 96 records</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">exact 1 + remainder identities</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">records stored in d00NormData</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">96</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">96</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">96</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.99em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[530]= \\begin{array}{c}\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{(i,j)} & \\text{D00 nonzero, of 12} & \\text{normalized = 1 + remainder ratio, exact}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,1\\right\\} & 12 & 12\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,2\\right\\} & 12 & 12\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,1\\right\\} & 12 & 12\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,2\\right\\} & 12 & 12\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,3\\right\\} & 12 & 12\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,1\\right\\} & 12 & 12\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,2\\right\\} & 12 & 12\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,3\\right\\} & 12 & 12\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\\\\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{D00 nonzero over all 96 records} & 96\\\\\\hline\\text{exact 1 + remainder identities} & 96\\\\\\hline\\text{records stored in d00NormData} & 96\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "15df3bb9-f83b-463b-98e7-2257ba886b15"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "The complete results are stored in d00NormData. Besides the previous fields, each record contains D00, D00nonzero, normalizedByD00, and remainderRatio.\n\nAt the benchmark point, D00 is nonzero for all 96 allowed pairing/state records. All 96 cases verify exactly that normalizedByD00 = 1 + remainderRatio. Thus this normalization is available throughout the present data set. It remains conditional for generic symbolic parameters: at special loci where D00 vanishes, division by the first residue-pair term is singular even if the full determinant is nonzero.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5.5 Vacuum-normalized first-residue ratio and the honest norm\n\nFor each allowed pairing $(i,j)$, first divide the determinant by its own first residue-pair contribution $D_{00}$, and then divide by the same quantity evaluated on the vacuum state $\\mu_{\\rm vac}=[S+P,S+P,0,0]$:\n\n$$\n\\mathcal N^{(00)}_{A;i,j}\n=\\frac{N^{AA}_{i,j}/D^{A}_{00;i,j}}\n       {N^{\\rm vac}_{i,j}/D^{\\rm vac}_{00;i,j}}.\n$$\n\nThis definition guarantees $\\mathcal N^{(00)}_{{\\rm vac};i,j}=1$. It differs from dividing every raw determinant by $D^{\\rm vac}_{00}$ and then vacuum-normalizing: in that latter construction the $D^{\\rm vac}_{00}$ factors cancel, leaving only $N^{AA}/N^{\\rm vac}$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 16. Vacuum-normalize N/D00, then compare with PsiL.PsiR. ---- *)\nClearAll[\n  ND00vacuumBaseline, ND00vacuumNormalized, honestDatum,\n  honestVacuumNormalized, d00VacuumNormData, d00VacuumSummary,\n  d00StateDependenceSummary\n  ];\n\nND00vacuumBaseline[S_, P_, i_, j_] :=\n  ND00normalized[S, P, vacuumState[S, P], i, j];\n\nND00vacuumNormalized[S_, P_, state_, i_, j_] :=\n  Together[\n   ND00normalized[S, P, state, i, j]/\n    ND00vacuumBaseline[S, P, i, j]\n   ];\n\nhonestDatum[S_, P_, mu_] :=\n  First@Select[honestNormData,\n    Function[row, row[\"SP\"] === {S, P} && row[\"mu\"] === mu]];\n\nhonestVacuumNormalized[S_, P_, state_] :=\n  Together[\n   honestDatum[S, P, state[\"mu\"]][\"honestNorm\"]/\n    honestDatum[S, P, vacuumState[S, P][\"mu\"]][\"honestNorm\"]\n   ];\n\nd00VacuumNormData = Map[\n  Function[row,\n   Module[{sp = row[\"SP\"], pair = row[\"pairing\"], vacMu, vacRow,\n     honestRow, honestVacRow, doubleRatio, honestRatio,\n     cState, cVac, factorDirect, factorFromConversions},\n    vacMu = vacuumState[sp[[1]], sp[[2]]][\"mu\"];\n    vacRow = First@Select[d00NormData,\n       Function[r,\n        r[\"SP\"] === sp && r[\"pairing\"] === pair && r[\"mu\"] === vacMu]];\n    honestRow = honestDatum[sp[[1]], sp[[2]], row[\"mu\"]];\n    honestVacRow = honestDatum[sp[[1]], sp[[2]], vacMu];\n    doubleRatio = Together[\n      row[\"normalizedByD00\"]/vacRow[\"normalizedByD00\"]];\n    honestRatio = Together[\n      honestRow[\"honestNorm\"]/honestVacRow[\"honestNorm\"]];\n    cState = Together[row[\"NAA\"]/honestRow[\"honestNorm\"]];\n    cVac = Together[vacRow[\"NAA\"]/honestVacRow[\"honestNorm\"]];\n    factorDirect = Together[doubleRatio/honestRatio];\n    factorFromConversions = Together[\n      (cState/cVac) (vacRow[\"D00\"]/row[\"D00\"])];\n    Join[row, <|\n      \"D00vacuumBaseline\" -> vacRow[\"normalizedByD00\"],\n      \"vacuumNormalizedByD00\" -> doubleRatio,\n      \"honestVacuumNormalized\" -> honestRatio,\n      \"SoVtoHonestConversion\" -> cState,\n      \"vacuumSoVtoHonestConversion\" -> cVac,\n      \"factorRelativeToHonest\" -> factorDirect,\n      \"factorFromRawConversions\" -> factorFromConversions,\n      \"honestRelationExact\" ->\n       (Together[doubleRatio - factorFromConversions honestRatio] === 0 &&\n        Together[factorDirect - factorFromConversions] === 0)\n      |>]\n    ]],\n  d00NormData];\n\nd00VacuumSummary = Table[\n  With[{rows = Select[d00VacuumNormData,\n      Function[row, row[\"pairing\"] === pair]]},\n   {pair,\n    Count[rows,\n     row_ /; row[\"mu\"] ===\n        vacuumState[row[\"SP\"][[1]], row[\"SP\"][[2]]][\"mu\"] &&\n       row[\"vacuumNormalizedByD00\"] === 1],\n    Count[rows, row_ /; TrueQ[row[\"honestRelationExact\"]]],\n    Count[rows, row_ /; row[\"factorRelativeToHonest\"] === 1],\n    Length@DeleteDuplicates[\n      Function[row, row[\"factorRelativeToHonest\"]] /@ rows]\n    }],\n  {pair, allowedPairings}];\n\nd00StateDependenceSummary = Map[\n  Function[key,\n   With[{rows = Select[d00VacuumNormData,\n       Function[row, {row[\"SP\"], row[\"mu\"]} === key]]},\n    {key[[1]], key[[2]],\n     Length@DeleteDuplicates[\n       Function[row, row[\"vacuumNormalizedByD00\"]] /@ rows],\n     Length@DeleteDuplicates[\n       Function[row, row[\"factorRelativeToHonest\"]] /@ rows]}\n    ]],\n  DeleteDuplicates[\n   Function[row, {row[\"SP\"], row[\"mu\"]}] /@ d00VacuumNormData]];\n\nGrid[{\n  {Grid[\n    Prepend[d00VacuumSummary,\n     {\"(i,j)\", \"vacuum = 1, of 3\", \"exact conversion identity, of 12\",\n      \"conversion factor = 1, of 12\", \"distinct conversion factors\"}],\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]},\n  {Grid[\n    Prepend[d00StateDependenceSummary,\n     {\"(S,P)\", \"mu\", \"distinct double ratios over 8 pairings\",\n      \"distinct conversion factors over 8 pairings\"}],\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]},\n  {Grid[{\n     {\"vacuum checks over all pairings and (S,P)\",\n      Count[d00VacuumNormData,\n       row_ /; row[\"mu\"] ===\n          vacuumState[row[\"SP\"][[1]], row[\"SP\"][[2]]][\"mu\"] &&\n         row[\"vacuumNormalizedByD00\"] === 1]},\n     {\"independent exact conversion identities over all 96 records\",\n      Count[d00VacuumNormData,\n       row_ /; TrueQ[row[\"honestRelationExact\"]]]},\n     {\"records stored in d00VacuumNormData\", Length[d00VacuumNormData]}\n     }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]}\n  }, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
