t;, 4, 4]} at position 1 is not a non-empty square matrix.                                                                  7  147     147      441   21                     21             7                441           21                                     21                  7                     63           21                                         7  147     147      441   21                     21             7                441           21                                     21                  7                     63           21                                                              7  147     147      441   21                     21             7                441           21                                     21                  7                     63           21                                         7  147     147      441   21                     21             7                441           21                                     21                  7                     63           21</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">General::stop: Further output of Det::matsq will be suppressed during this calculation.</div></details>",
