   "value": "For these first 21 states the values are therefore\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{c|c}\n(S,P) & \\widehat Q_{12}^{(1)}\\text{ over its states in }(j,k)\\text{ order}\\\\ \\hline\n(1,1) & 1,\\ \\frac12,\\ \\frac16\\\\\n(2,1) & 1,\\ \\frac23,\\ \\frac3{10}\\\\\n(2,2) & 1,\\ \\frac12,\\ \\frac13,\\ \\frac15,\\ \\frac18,\\ \\frac1{20}\\\\\n(3,1) & 1,\\ \\frac34,\\ \\frac25\\\\\n(3,2) & 1,\\ \\frac35,\\ \\frac12,\\ \\frac27,\\ \\frac8{35},\\ \\frac3{25}\n\\end{array}\n$$\n\nEach entry agrees exactly with $1/(\\Psi_L\\cdot\\Psi_R)$.",
